---
// About section — extracted from legacy index.html on 2026-05-20
---
<!-- ═══════════ ABOUT / EXPERTISE ═══════════ -->
<section class="block" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">01 · Scope of Work</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What I <em>build.</em></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">
        Three core pillars — and the architectural seams between them. The places where most teams either over-engineer or compromise; where I refuse to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pillars-wrap">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar__num">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="pillar__title">Headless &amp; Hybrid <em>Storefronts.</em></h3>
            <p class="pillar__desc">
              Decoupling Fortune-500 catalogs from platform ceilings. I build React/Next.js storefronts that sit on top of BigCommerce, Shopify or custom backends — without losing the ERP, ops, and tax plumbing the business already depends on.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar__tags">
              <span class="pillar__tag">BigCommerce React Hybrid</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Next.js + Shopify</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">SSR / ISR / Edge</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Sanity · Payload</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar__num">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="pillar__title">High-Compliance &amp; <em>Regulated.</em></h3>
            <p class="pillar__desc">
              Architecting systems that have to pass federal audits, not just unit tests. iGaming, identity, and government-regulated platforms with geofencing, responsible-play workflows, immutable evidence frameworks, and cryptographic verification at the boundary.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar__tags">
              <span class="pillar__tag">Federal / State iGaming</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Geofencing</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Immutable Evidence</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Crypto Identity</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar">
          <div class="pillar__num">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="pillar__title">Enterprise Middleware &amp; <em>Cloud.</em></h3>
            <p class="pillar__desc">
              The unglamorous backbone — NetSuite/ERP integration, Celigo orchestration, Azure Functions, Cosmos DB, AWS, and the serverless plumbing that lets a startup look enterprise and an enterprise move like a startup.
            </p>
            <div class="pillar__tags">
              <span class="pillar__tag">NetSuite ↔ Shopify/BC</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Celigo / iPaaS</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Azure Functions</span>
              <span class="pillar__tag">Postgres · Supabase · AWS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stats__cell">
            <div class="stats__v">120<small>+</small></div>
            <div class="stats__k">Engagements Shipped</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stats__cell">
            <div class="stats__v">14<small>+</small></div>
            <div class="stats__k">Years Architecting</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stats__cell">
            <div class="stats__v">0</div>
            <div class="stats__k">Compromises</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="clients">
          <strong>Selected:</strong>
          <span>Rust-Oleum</span><span class="sep"></span>
          <span>DC iLottery</span><span class="sep"></span>
          <span>Nuun Hydration</span><span class="sep"></span>
          <span>AgeVerify</span><span class="sep"></span>
          <span>McDonald's</span><span class="sep"></span>
          <span>Northwest Permanente</span>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:36px; padding:24px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--bg-3);">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--accent);">Currently</div>
          <div style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.015em;">Architecting Headless-Lite for Fortune 500</div>
          <p style="color:var(--text-2); font-size: 14.5px; line-height:1.65; margin-top:8px;">Designing React hybrid storefronts embedded into BigCommerce — a new pattern for Fortune-500 catalogs that need scale and platform safety in the same build.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
